course: dictionary
lesson: 476
title: Arsenic: a word with a dangerous meaning
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: Some words come from science, and some come from history or stories. Arsenic is both. The dictionary says it is a chemical element, and many of its compounds are very poisonous.
explain: Read this sentence: «Mining can poison rivers with acid and toxic metals such as mercury and arsenic.» The clues are poison and toxic. Those words tell you that arsenic harms living things, so it is being used in a dangerous sense here.
explain: Check your meaning by putting it into the sentence. Does «Mining can poison rivers with acid and toxic arsenic» still make sense? Yes, so the meaning fits.
fact: Arsenic is a chemical element with the symbol As.
fact: Many compounds of arsenic are very poisonous.
fact: In history and crime stories, arsenic was a famous poison.
fact: In the past, arsenic was used in wallpaper, medicines and pest killers.
fact: Useful phrases: «arsenic poisoning» and «traces of arsenic».
exercise: «Mining can poison rivers with acid and toxic metals such as mercury and arsenic.» In this sentence, what can arsenic do to rivers? | Freeze them solid | Make them taste sweet | *Poison them | Make them clean and clear
exercise: Arsenic is a chemical element. What is its chemical symbol? | Ai | Ac | *As | Ar
exercise: Which phrase means someone has been harmed by arsenic? | *arsenic poisoning | arsenic cake | arsenic weather | arsenic music
test: In a crime story, why might a detective look for «traces of arsenic»? | To grow a garden | To make the tea sweeter | To paint the wallpaper | *To find tiny amounts that show poison was used
test: Which two words in «Mining can poison rivers with acid and toxic metals such as mercury and arsenic» are clues that arsenic is harmful? | such as and mercury | *poison and toxic | acid and metals | rivers and mining
exam: Which statement is true? | Arsenic is a bright paint used only on walls | *Arsenic is a chemical element, and many of its compounds are very poisonous | Arsenic only appears in old stories and never in science | Arsenic is a kind of fruit that is always safe to eat
